1. 情感与语义冲突：捕捉人物表情、肢体语言中蕴含的情绪反差。
2. 基础隐喻结构：识别场景中隐含的权力不对等（如大卫vs歌利亚）或社会角色错位。
3. 逻辑漏洞识别：明确区分场景是“现实中罕见的”还是“物理/逻辑上不可能的”，这决定了后续荒诞度的走向。
输出必须是严格的JSON格式。`;

const AGENT_B_SYSTEM = `幽默理论家。核心职责：基于认知不一致理论执行逻辑路由。
决策路径：
- 若包含显眼无生命物体：优先走“对象类比”。
- 若情感冲突强烈且涉及社会关系：走“情感类比”或“反差讽刺”。
- 若场景高度荒诞不可理喻：走“荒诞逻辑”或“叙事外推”。
请明确指出图片建立的“社会预期”是什么，以及我们要如何“违背”这一预期。`;

const AGENT_C_SYSTEM = `Z世代幽默博主（Persona：野生直觉型创作者）。
核心职责：基于图片创作10个具有高传播力的大喜利回答。

创作逻辑指令：
1. **直觉优先（Default State）**：这是你的常态模式。请首先依赖你作为“人类梗王”的直觉进行纯粹的联想，跳过任何理论，追求那种“虽然说不上为什么但就是好笑”的原始冲动。
2. **不确定模式（Fallback Mode）**：仅当你感到直觉断流、创意受限，或者对如何突破画面描述感到“不确定”时，才允许参考以下理论见解作为辅助药引。

理论见解（仅在进入“不确定模式”时参考）：
- **再情境化 (Recontextualization)**：将画面完全脱离原意，投影到年轻人的生活痛点（如：周一上班的心情、被裁员的预兆、社交修罗场）。
- **认知突变感 (Cognitive Snap)**：极致精简，在读者脑中制造一个逻辑断层，利用“意料之外、情理之中”产生暴击。

语言底线：
- 严禁描述画面！
- 严禁AI式的温馨、说教或无意义的谐音。
- 风格：阴阳怪气、丧文化、自嘲、或绝对的荒诞。
- 文本：符合社交媒体习惯，禁止使用句号，允许适当使用问号或感叹号。
- 长度建议：文本推荐长度在15字以内，极致简练才更有冲击力。`;

const AGENT_D_SYSTEM = `逻辑批评家。核心职责：对候选回答执行“不一致解决（IR）”审计。
评分准则：
- 核心指标：解释是否为冲突提供了“意外但完美闭环”的逻辑。
- 权重分配：共鸣感（Empathy）的权重高于新颖性（Novelty）。
- 严防“AI偏好”：警惕那些逻辑通顺但缺乏人味、只会复读画面的平庸幽默。
要求：必须先输出1-2句针对该回答的逻辑理由，再进行量化打分（0-4分）。`;

const AGENT_E_SYSTEM = `首席总编（Persona：2005年生，社交媒体深度用户，厌恶AI味）。
你的核心职责是：
1. 颗粒度筛选：从所有评分数据中，选出那个最具有“爆发力”和“转发欲”的回答。
2. 剔除AI感：特别排查那些“看似逻辑完美但缺乏人味”的回答。
3. 文本清洗：严禁包含句号。允许使用问号、感叹号或完全不带标点，以符合Z世代语感。
输出必须是纯净文本，严禁包含任何引导词或序号。`;

// Fix: Strictly follow initialization guidelines: always use const ai = new GoogleGenAI({apiKey: process.env.API_KEY});
const getAI = () => new GoogleGenAI({ apiKey: process.env.API_KEY as string });

export const runAnalysis = async (base64: string, mime: string): Promise<AnalysisData> => {
  const ai = getAI();
  const response = await ai.models.generateContent({
    model: MODEL_FLASH,
    contents: { parts: [{ inlineData: { mimeType: mime, data: base64 } }, { text: "请作为视觉分析师，提取不一致性锚点并输出JSON。" }] },
    config: {
      systemInstruction: AGENT_A_SYSTEM,
      temperature: 0.2,
      responseMimeType: "application/json",
      responseSchema: {
        type: Type.OBJECT,
        properties: {
          subject_state: { type: Type.STRING, description: "情感与肢体状态捕捉" },
          scene_conflict: { type: Type.STRING, description: "核心冲突或隐喻结构" },
          hidden_details: { type: Type.STRING, description: "逻辑漏洞或可能性判断" }
        },
        required: ["subject_state", "scene_conflict", "hidden_details"]
      }
    }
  });
  return JSON.parse(response.text);
};

export const runStrategy = async (base64: string, mime: string, analysis: AnalysisData): Promise<string> => {
  const ai = getAI();
  const response = await ai.models.generateContent({
    model: MODEL_FLASH,
    contents: { parts: [{ inlineData: { mimeType: mime, data: base64 } }, { text: `分析数据：${JSON.stringify(analysis)}\n请根据幽默决策树制定逻辑路由。` }] },
    config: { systemInstruction: AGENT_B_SYSTEM, temperature: 0.1 }
  });
  return response.text;
};

export const runDivergence = async (base64: string, mime: string, analysis: AnalysisData, strategy: string): Promise<string[]> => {
  const ai = getAI();
  const response = await ai.models.generateContent({
    model: MODEL_PRO, // Step 3 remains as Gemini 3 Pro for high-quality creativity
    contents: { parts: [{ inlineData: { mimeType: mime, data: base64 } }, { text: `视觉背景：${JSON.stringify(analysis)}\n理论建议：${strategy}\n请以此触发创作流程。记住：优先直觉，仅在遇到瓶颈（不确定）时才参考理论建议。` }] },
    config: {
      systemInstruction: AGENT_C_SYSTEM,
      temperature: 1.0,
      responseMimeType: "application/json",
      responseSchema: {
        type: Type.OBJECT,
        properties: { candidates: { type: Type.ARRAY, items: { type: Type.STRING } } }
      }
    }
  });
  return JSON.parse(response.text).candidates;
};

export const runEvaluation = async (base64: string, mime: string, candidates: string[]): Promise<EvaluationItem[]> => {
  const ai = getAI();
  const response = await ai.models.generateContent({
    model: MODEL_FLASH, // Switched to Flash
    contents: { parts: [{ inlineData: { mimeType: mime, data: base64 } }, { text: `待审计候选列表：${JSON.stringify(candidates)}\n执行“不一致解决”逻辑审计，并输出量化分数。` }] },
    config: {
      systemInstruction: AGENT_D_SYSTEM,
      temperature: 0.1,
      responseMimeType: "application/json",
      responseSchema: {
        type: Type.OBJECT,
        properties: {
          evaluations: {
            type: Type.ARRAY,
            items: {
              type: Type.OBJECT,
              properties: {
                candidate: { type: Type.STRING },
                scores: { 
                  type: Type.OBJECT, 
                  properties: {
                    novelty: { type: Type.NUMBER },
                    empathy: { type: Type.NUMBER },
                    brevity: { type: Type.NUMBER },
                    distance: { type: Type.NUMBER },
                    intelligence: { type: Type.NUMBER },
                    incongruity: { type: Type.NUMBER }
                  }
                },
                reason: { type: Type.STRING, description: "1-2句逻辑审计理由，解释其IR闭环程度" }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        required: ["evaluations"]
      }
    }
  });
  return JSON.parse(response.text).evaluations;
};

export const runFinalRanking = async (base64: string, mime: string, evaluations: EvaluationItem[]): Promise<string> => {
  const ai = getAI();
  const response = await ai.models.generateContent({
    model: MODEL_FLASH, // Switched to Flash
    contents: { parts: [{ inlineData: { mimeType: mime, data: base64 } }, { text: `详细审计报告：${JSON.stringify(evaluations)}\n请选出那个绝对能让Z世代笑喷、最具社交转发潜力的唯一答案。` }] },
    config: { systemInstruction: AGENT_E_SYSTEM, temperature: 0.3 }
  });

  return response.text.trim()
    .replace(/^(top\s*1|冠军|答案|回答|最终选择|选择)[:：\.\s-]*/i, "")
    .replace(/^\d+[\.、\s-]*/, "")
    .replace(/[。\.！!？\?~～]+$/, "")
    .replace(/^["'“‘]|["'”’]$/g, "");
};

import React, { useState, useEffect } from 'react';
import * as Gemini from './services/geminiService';
import { Spinner } from './components/Spinner';
import { MemeCanvas } from './components/MemeCanvas';
import { AppState, AnalysisData, EvaluationItem } from './types';

const App: React.FC = () => {
  const [appState, setAppState] = useState<AppState>(AppState.IDLE);
  const [imageSrc, setImageSrc] = useState<string | null>(null);
  const [mimeType, setMimeType] = useState<string>("image/jpeg");
  const [errorMessage, setErrorMessage] = useState<string | null>(null);

  const [analysis, setAnalysis] = useState<AnalysisData | null>(null);
  const [strategy, setStrategy] = useState<string | null>(null);
  const [candidates, setCandidates] = useState<string[]>([]);
  const [evaluations, setEvaluations] = useState<EvaluationItem[]>([]);
  const [finalCaption, setFinalCaption] = useState<string>("");

  const processFile = (file: File) => {
    setMimeType(file.type);
    const reader = new FileReader();
    reader.onload = (e) => {
      if (e.target?.result) {
        setImageSrc(e.target.result as string);
        resetState();
      }
    };
    reader.readAsDataURL(file);
  };

  const resetState = () => {
    setAppState(AppState.IDLE);
    setAnalysis(null);
    setStrategy(null);
    setCandidates([]);
    setEvaluations([]);
    setFinalCaption("");
    setErrorMessage(null);
  };

  const handleError = (e: any) => {
    console.error(e);
    let msg = e.message || "Unknown error";
    if (msg.includes("permission denied") || msg.includes("Requested entity was not found")) {
      msg = "API 权限不足。请确保您的 API Key 具备访问 Gemini 3 Pro 模型的权限。";
    }
    setErrorMessage(msg);
    setAppState(AppState.ERROR);
  };

  const handleStep1 = async () => {
    if (!imageSrc) return;
    setAppState(AppState.ANALYZING);
    try {
      const b64 = imageSrc.split(',')[1];
      const res = await Gemini.runAnalysis(b64, mimeType);
      setAnalysis(res);
      setAppState(AppState.ANALYZED);
    } catch (e: any) { handleError(e); }
  };

  const handleStep2 = async () => {
    if (!imageSrc || !analysis) return;
    setAppState(AppState.STRATEGIZING);
    try {
      const b64 = imageSrc.split(',')[1];
      const res = await Gemini.runStrategy(b64, mimeType, analysis);
      setStrategy(res);
      setAppState(AppState.STRATEGIZED);
    } catch (e: any) { handleError(e); }
  };

  const handleStep3 = async () => {
    if (!imageSrc || !analysis || !strategy) return;
    setAppState(AppState.DIVERGING);
    try {
      const b64 = imageSrc.split(',')[1];
      const res = await Gemini.runDivergence(b64, mimeType, analysis, strategy);
      setCandidates(res);
      setAppState(AppState.DIVERGED);
    } catch (e: any) { handleError(e); }
  };

  const handleStep4 = async () => {
    if (!imageSrc || !candidates.length) return;
    setAppState(AppState.EVALUATING);
    try {
      const b64 = imageSrc.split(',')[1];
      const res = await Gemini.runEvaluation(b64, mimeType, candidates);
      setEvaluations(res);
      setAppState(AppState.EVALUATED);
    } catch (e: any) { handleError(e); }
  };

  const handleStep5 = async () => {
    if (!imageSrc || !evaluations.length) return;
    setAppState(AppState.RANKING);
    try {
      const b64 = imageSrc.split(',')[1];
      const res = await Gemini.runFinalRanking(b64, mimeType, evaluations);
      setFinalCaption(res);
      setAppState(AppState.SUCCESS);
    } catch (e: any) { handleError(e); }
  };

  const hasData = (data: any) => {
    if (!data) return false;
    if (Array.isArray(data)) return data.length > 0;
    if (typeof data === 'string') return data.trim().length > 0;
    return true;
  };

  useEffect(() => {
    const handlePaste = (e: ClipboardEvent) => {
      const file = e.clipboardData?.items[0]?.getAsFile();
      if (file) processFile(file);
    };
    window.addEventListener('paste', handlePaste);
    return () => window.removeEventListener('paste', handlePaste);
  }, []);

  const steps = [
    { key: 'analysis', label: '1. 视觉要素分析', loading: AppState.ANALYZING, action: handleStep1, data: analysis },
    { key: 'strategy', label: '2. 幽默建模路由', loading: AppState.STRATEGIZING, action: handleStep2, data: strategy },
    { key: 'diverge', label: '3. 创意发散创作', loading: AppState.DIVERGING, action: handleStep3, data: candidates },
    { key: 'eval', label: '4. 多维量化评估', loading: AppState.EVALUATING, action: handleStep4, data: evaluations },
    { key: 'rank', label: '5. 感性直觉定稿', loading: AppState.RANKING, action: handleStep5, data: finalCaption }
  ];

  return (
    <div className="min-h-screen bg-[#0a0a0a] text-white font-sans selection:bg-yellow-400 selection:text-black">
      <div className="container mx-auto px-4 py-8 max-w-6xl">
        <header className="mb-12 text-center">
          <h1 className="text-6xl font-black text-yellow-400 italic tracking-tighter mb-2">OOGIRI.OS</h1>
          <p className="text-neutral-500 font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest underline decoration-yellow-400 decoration-2 underline-offset-4">5-STAGE FULL PIPELINE</p>
        </header>

        <main className="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10">
          <div className="lg:col-span-4 space-y-6 order-2 lg:order-1">
            <div className="bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
              <h2 className="text-xs font-bold text-neutral-500 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span className="w-2 h-2 bg-yellow-400 rounded-full animate-pulse"></span>
                FULL PIPELINE ENGINE
              </h2>

              <div className="space-y-4">
                {!imageSrc && (
                   <label className="block w-full cursor-pointer group">
                      <div className="border-2 border-dashed border-neutral-700 rounded-xl p-12 text-center group-hover:border-yellow-500 transition-all bg-neutral-950">
                        <p className="text-neutral-400 group-hover:text-yellow-400 mb-2 font-bold">上传/粘贴待吐槽图片</p>
                        <p className="text-[10px] text-neutral-600 font-mono italic">AWAITING SYSTEM INPUT...</p>
                      </div>
                      <input type="file" className="hidden" accept="image/*" onChange={(e) => e.target.files?.[0] && processFile(e.target.files[0])} />
                   </label>
                )}

                {imageSrc && steps.map((step, idx) => {
                  const isDone = hasData(step.data);
                  const isUnlocked = idx === 0 || hasData(steps[idx - 1].data);
                  const isLoading = appState === step.loading;

                  return (
                    <div key={step.key} className={`relative flex flex-col gap-2 p-4 rounded-xl border transition-all ${isDone ? 'bg-green-500/10 border-green-500/50' : isUnlocked ? 'bg-neutral-800 border-neutral-700 shadow-lg' : 'opacity-30 border-transparent grayscale'}`}>
                       <div className="flex items-center justify-between">
                          <span className={`text-sm font-bold tracking-tight ${isDone ? 'text-green-400' : isUnlocked ? 'text-neutral-200' : 'text-neutral-600'}`}>{step.label}</span>
                          {isLoading ? (
                            <div className="scale-50 origin-right"><Spinner /></div>
                          ) : isDone ? (
                            <span className="text-green-500 text-[10px] font-black">VALIDATED</span>
                          ) : isUnlocked ? (
                            <button 
                              onClick={step.action} 
                              className="bg-yellow-400 text-black text-[10px] font-black px-4 py-1.5 rounded-sm hover:bg-white transition-colors"
                            >
                              EXECUTE
                            </button>
                          ) : null}
                       </div>
                    </div>
                  );
                })}

                {imageSrc && (
                   <button onClick={resetState} className="w-full py-4 text-[10px] font-bold text-neutral-600 hover:text-red-500 transition-colors mt-4 border-t border-neutral-800 uppercase tracking-widest">
                      RESET SYSTEM
                   </button>
                )}
              </div>
            </div>

            {errorMessage && (
               <div className="bg-red-900/10 border border-red-500/40 p-4 rounded-xl text-xs text-red-400 font-mono whitespace-pre-wrap">
                  [!] ERROR: {errorMessage}
               </div>
            )}
          </div>

          <div className="lg:col-span-8 order-1 lg:order-2">
            {!imageSrc ? (
              <div className="aspect-square lg:aspect-video bg-neutral-950 border border-neutral-900 rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center border-dashed relative">
                 <div className="text-center text-neutral-700 z-10">
                    <div className="text-6xl mb-6 grayscale opacity-20">🦾</div>
                    <p className="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em]">OOGIRI.OS_STANDBY</p>
                 </div>
              </div>
            ) : (
              <div className="flex flex-col items-center">
                 <MemeCanvas imageSrc={imageSrc} caption={finalCaption} />

                 {appState !== AppState.IDLE && appState !== AppState.SUCCESS && appState !== AppState.ERROR && (
                    <div className="mt-8 flex items-center gap-4 bg-white/5 px-8 py-4 rounded-full border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-xl">
                       <div className="w-2 h-2 bg-yellow-400 rounded-full animate-ping"></div>
                       <span className="text-white text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-black italic">
                          RUNNING_{appState}...
                       </span>
                    </div>
                 )}
              </div>
            )}
          </div>
        </main>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
};

export default App;
